    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Where this expected behaviour comes from: the Inventory Value report specification, version 4, requirement S10-R3, which says: \"Both downloads include only the columns currently shown, in the same left-to-right order as the screen, with Total Cost last.\" That covers both halves of this ticket \u2014 which columns appear, and the order they appear in."
