   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The same specification, requirement S10-R7, says: \"Money and Margin % use two-decimal and one-decimal formats respectively; an undefined Margin % shows \u201c\u2014\u201d.\" A number is asked for, not a dressed-up money string."
    }
